WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.280
Russia's got some good food!

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.060
Yeah.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:46.680
Indeed.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.240
What's got everyone so down?

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:52.140
It's almost time for the World Championship finals!

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.350
We've gotta hustle!

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.070
We can't afford to hustle.

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:00.530
Not after what happened.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:05.660
From the very start, Kai didn't think of us as friends.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:09.980
Nothing changed from back when
he was a member of the Shell Killers.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:13.030
Can't we just let this whole Kai thing go?

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:15.820
In the Finals, all <i>we</i> can do is what <i>we</i> do best.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.000
A bit cold of you.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:21.510
Even if we just sit around and mope about
whoever's gone, there's nothing we can do.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.620
Is Max still asleep?

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.850
He went to the airport.

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:27.640
The airport?

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.730
I believe his mother is returning home.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.020
He's seeing her off.

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:35.350
They're leaving even though the
Finals are right around the corner?

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:41.150
Showdown at Lake Baikal

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.770
Only three more days until the Finals, right?

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:53.910
Yeah. There will be one match a day, so the
whole thing is three matches over three days.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.190
One day to return to America,

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.880
two days to analyze the data,

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.500
and one day to return to Russia...

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:05.420
I'll make back it in time for
the second day of the Finals.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:10.690
I'll use everything the PPB has on the
Russian Team when analyzing our data.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.140
That includes data on their Sacred Beasts.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:15.840
Whatever it takes to make
ourselves useful to you boys.

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:18.340
Thank you, Mama! I'll be waiting!

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.960
The Russian team is chock-full of mystery!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:23.610
So if we find some sort of <i>weak point</i>...

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:25.000
Yes.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.660
Kai...

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:44.970
Is that Max?

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.040
Who are you?

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.010
What's up, Professor?

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.300
I have come to pick you up.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:56.550
Pick us up?

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.500
Kai is waiting for you.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:03:59.770
Kai is..?

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.980
Yes, he said he "must" meet with you.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:05.200
Unfortunately, we no longer have a need to...

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:09.110
What's wrong with that, Professor?
Kai wants us to pick him up!

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.800
We'll go, no matter where he is!

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:14.370
Turns out you were the one worried most...

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.150
That's Takao for you.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.700
We seem to be going rather far.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.750
We will arrive soon.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.050
Please be patient.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:33.200
I wonder what Kai wants...
Suddenly calling for us like this.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:36.290
I'm sure he had a falling
out with the Russian Team,

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.470
and is all like, "I wanna go back to the BBA Team!"

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.230
Sounds unlikely.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.280
Yeah, I know...

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.780
That's...!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.960
What a huge lake!

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.160
It looks kind of dark.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.810
Often called Russia's <i>Blue Pearl</i>,

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:12.460
it is considered the world's oldest lake.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.020
It's Lake Baikal!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.640
It looks dark because the ice is so neat.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:20.510
It's completely frozen over
without reflecting any light!

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.180
Are we gonna land on it?

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:28.040
We'll be fine. A car could drive over this!

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.480
It's about one meter thick!

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.740
One meter?! Wow!

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:34.020
Isn't that..?

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:39.460
It's Kai.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.320
The time has come.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:52.830
Kai!

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.840
You're one short.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:57.600
Kai...

00:05:58.340 --> 00:05:59.870
Kinomiya!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.850
Kai... are you serious?

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.240
I have long waited for this day.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:23.040
Ever since you beat me in the
BBA Battle Tournament finals,

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.330
I have been anticipating this day.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.240
What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:32.200
It means that the time has
come for me to defeat you!

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:36.840
I never cared about the
World Championships to begin with!

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:40.460
All I want is to become the
strongest Beyblader in the world.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:44.780
I have obtained the world's
strongest Bey, Black Dranzer.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.590
The Russian Team isn't my enemy...

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:51.220
but if I defeat you, I can truly call myself the best!

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:53.770
Kai...

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:54.780
You've...

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.720
I challenge you, Kinomiya. Let's finish this.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:58.740
Takao...

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.330
Fine by me!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:03.540
Kai, if that's what you want, I'll do it!

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:05.520
No regrets!

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:06.490
Takao!

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:07.700
Don't stop me, Rei!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.040
No. I'll fight, too!

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:13.880
Up until now, I considered Kai
a friend of mine, if nothing else.

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:18.590
Now that you've become our enemy,
my heart is filled with frustration.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.940
It knows the pain of having a friend turn on you.

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:25.570
I'll show you just how painful that feels!

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.170
I'll be fighting as well!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:27.680
Huh?

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.200
I'll show Kai the pain that
cuts deep into my tiny heart—

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:36.680
and the screams that make my
hands tremble—until he begs for mercy!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.730
Fine. Come at me all at once.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.560
I planned on defeating you all either way.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.430
This'll save me some time.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:47.260
It's too bad we're down one.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:50.560
I'll be sure to take Genbu later.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.000
We won't be holding back!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.210
Take on all of our pain!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.450
Prepare yourself!

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:03.460
I'll burn your feelings to a crisp with Black Dranzer!

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:04.260
Come on!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.980
It's almost time for you to go.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.540
It is.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:20.040
I almost forgot.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.440
I have a present for you, Max.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.530
It's something I made
after analyzing Draciel.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:32.080
Quick and thorough,
making full use of the PPB's systems.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.070
For me?

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:36.100
Yes, for you.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.960
Its defense and endurance have been greatly improved.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.030
I hope you can use it.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:42.810
Of course!

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:45.220
I'm so happy, Mama! Thank you.

00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:47.860
Can you give it a name, Mom?

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.120
Right...

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:50.930
How does Draciel Fortress sound?

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.600
This is the Bey my Mama made for me.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.310
Draciel Fortress.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:56.570
Like a stronghold.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.570
Yeah, I like it!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:08:59.980
Max!!

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:05.360
What's gotten you so worked up, Emily?

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.450
Take a look at this!

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:13.550
This photo was taken by a satellite! There's—

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:14.280
They're..!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.540
It's Takao and your friends!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.450
Yeah, but...

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:22.160
They're about to fight Kai?!
This is bad. I have to help them!

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.290
Where are they?

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:25.840
The prettiest, deepest lake in the world!

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:27.580
Lake Baikal...

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.840
No...

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.760
I can't make it from here!

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.080
It's okay, Max.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.910
I'll make sure you arrive on time.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.350
Max...

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:54.520
Group together all you want,
but the weak will always be weak!

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:56.080
Don't underestimate us!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:07.520
T-The pain in my heart...

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:09.580
Leave the rest to us.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.940
Go, Byakko! Give him a Tiger Claw,
with all your feeling!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:22.020
That will not work on Black Dranzer!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.350
Appear, Galeon! Dark Lightning!

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:33.320
Feel Lai's pain of having
his Sacred Beast stolen!

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.080
Tryhorn!!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.340
Byakko!

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:50.960
Takao!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:54.540
I'm on it! I'll beat Kai, no matter what!

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:57.670
So I don't waste Rei and the Professor's efforts,

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:01.150
and more importantly, to save Kai from himself!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.600
This is the final battle!

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.970
I'm gonna win! Here I go!

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.810
Max, we're almost at Lake Baikal.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:31.870
Get ready.

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:32.870
Yeah.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.640
Kai!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.030
Kinomiya!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.200
Let's do it, Dragoon!

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.480
Phantom Hurricane!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.950
How weak!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.360
Black Dranzer, blow it away!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.700
Crap! Phantom Hurricane won't work!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.380
Is that all, Kinomiya?

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.490
What now?

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:13.380
Now it's my turn!

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:15.380
Galzzly Bear Axe!

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.840
Catty Bites!

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:29.930
Let me show you the true meaning of power.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.210
The dark Sacred Beast...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:34.560
Black Suzaku!!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.240
W-What's this?

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.580
Dark power?!

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:44.880
Black Suzaku?!

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:46.700
Don't lose, Dragoon!

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:56.960
S-Seiryuu...

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.970
He took out Seiryuu in one blow...

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.560
How powerful...

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:17.760
Darn it!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:18.990
Darn it!!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.450
How...

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:23.530
How could you?!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:29.550
Kai...

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:33.550
I did it! I finally did it!

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.860
I win!

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.210
I took my revenge.

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:38.400
You lose!

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.880
I'm taking Seiryu and Byakko.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:47.150
I will reign as the strongest Beyblader
in the world, both in name in and power!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:49.950
Seiryu!

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:50.980
B-Byakko!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.980
Kai, please wait!

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.480
Don't take their Sacred Beasts!

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:58.990
All your power belongs to me!

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:02.310
I will acquire all Sacred Beasts!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.080
I'm still here!

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.760
Max!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.080
Go Shoot!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.790
A new Draciel model?

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:27.220
You can do it, Max.

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:34.860
You can call yourself the
best <i>after</i> you beat me.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.070
Max! You made it!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.590
Sorry I'm late, Takao.

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.940
Kai! How could you do this?!

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:46.030
Did you come all this way to put
your Sacred Beast on a silver platter?

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.240
Go, Black Dranzer!

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.030
I won't go down so easily!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.760
Draciel Fortress!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.430
I'll end this with one attack!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:02.660
What?!

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:09.220
This is the power of Draciel Fortress!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.700
As the name implies, its defense is perfect!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.120
Cheap tricks!

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:16.370
Trygle! Trypio! Go get him!

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.360
That won't work on me!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.820
In that case, Black Suzaku..!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:33.280
Max!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.520
Look out!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:39.100
Draciel Fortress Defense!

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.350
What?!

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:46.470
What are you doing, Black Suzaku? Finish him!

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:49.310
Now, Takao! Beat Black Dranzer!

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:53.760
But Dragoon is already...

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.070
You've got another Bey, right?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.360
Right!

00:15:58.400 --> 00:15:59.730
Dranzer...

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.570
Okay!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.540
Come on, Black Dranzer! These guys should easily—

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.220
What?!

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.250
Dranzer?!

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:16.480
Yeah! This is the Dranzer you abandoned!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.750
Dranzer's crying..!

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.020
Impossible...

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:25.880
Those are Dranzer's tears!

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:28.370
They're <i>our</i> tears!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.600
Kai, we're crying just thinking of you!

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.710
We'll bring you down!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:41.270
Suzaku!!

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.280
What is this power?!

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:50.100
Don't you get it, Kai?!

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:52.910
Suzaku says it wants to defeat you!

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:56.310
Suzaku is burning so it can open your eyes!

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:57.300
- Kai!
- Kai!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.840
Go, Byakko!

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:09.060
Do it, Seiryuu!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.800
Protect them, Genbu!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:14.810
Kai! This is the power of their friendship!

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:20.330
When their strength becomes one,

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.180
it gives birth to incredible power!

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:26.500
That's right!

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:29.540
You can't beat us, not all by yourself!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:30.740
Impossible...

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.300
This is...

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:33.760
the power of our friendship!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.020
T-This can't be...

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.810
Kai!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.280
I...

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:15.400
Black Dranzer and Black Suzaku...

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:21.620
lost to Dranzer and Suzaku?!

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.430
Does this mean that the ultimate power...

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:29.270
and the power of Sacred Beasts and Beys...

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.840
can be earned through teamwork?

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:41.190
Is that it..?

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:46.220
Kai!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:50.490
The power of friendship..?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.290
I...

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:03.000
Kai!

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.030
Hurry! Grab my hand!

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:11.100
You're sinking!

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.840
Are you trying to save me?

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:16.700
I betrayed you!

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:17.340
Why would you..?

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:20.060
It's obvious! You're our friend!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.080
We might fight here and there,

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:25.050
but we can always make up!

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.810
Adversity strengthens our foundations!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:31.820
Kai! Grab my hand!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:33.820
You guys...

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:39.120
Kai!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.130
I can't abandon a friend in need!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.360
Grab my hand!!

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:48.170
I...

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:20.990
You didn't have to...

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.540
Now, let's head back together.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.670
The Finals are right around the corner.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:28.570
We need you.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:33.460
Kai, where are you going?

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.830
There's something I need to do.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:36.760
Kai!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.630
You forgot something.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:45.120
That's yours, right? Don't leave
without it, no matter where you're going.

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:49.350
Suzaku says it likes you more than me.

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:56.370
Will Kai be okay?

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:07.530
Kai...

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:19.180
It'll be fine. Kai knows.

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.980
He will return to the BBA!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.960
Yeah. You're right.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.520 --> 00:23:03.390
According to my analysis,
Borg has been concealing some terrifying plans.

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:06.360
The secrets that are about to
be unveiled are horrifying!

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:11.030
And the black shadows that block us off on our way to the finals..!

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:15.820
They're the strongest Bladers in the world: Borg's Big Four!

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:18.760
Next time: Borg's Assault!

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:24.420
In a serious development, Max..! We're in trouble!
